{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：10:06 2026-09-23 HKT<br/>發佈時間：10:06 2026-09-23 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：10:06 2026-09-23 HKT</p><p>今日（23日）早上8時31分，一輛運載混凝土的重型貨車沿錦田公路往八鄉方向行駛，當駛至近青朗公路交界時，撞倒一名過路的女子。63歲女事主昏迷不醒，其後由救護車送往博愛醫院搶救，最終不治。</p><p>意外後現場遺下一隻鞋，涉事55歲男司機協助警方調查。據司機報稱，當時其車輛沿綠燈行駛，女途人突然由右至左橫過馬路，將她撞斃。警方正調查意外原因。</p><img alt=\"運載混凝土的重型貨車撞斃女子。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/05cbce7022823709d4d31540aa129e14/2026-09/2_27.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b4777c093344d258cdd700daa1433c1d/2026-09/2_0_14.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"車底遺下一隻鞋。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e724ddcd32dc6a66116eac008f2db7f2/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-23_at_09_48_36.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警方在場調查事件。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/da766b87317fb4065371091961c1c801/2026-09/1_1_32.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b8ae75fce73727404c4b37fdbff05b2f/2026-09/5_1_16.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b8d1ee7d6b67e5bad14dfc29606a2f21/2026-09/8_0_1.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"司機協助警員調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2c26ceaf2aa2cb251e8d5fc00dab92ac/2026-09/7_1_7.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8963eea269a6e7632990621a3c7d5624/2026-09/6_9.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/57e6cd6328f71a169d5778ed8161241f/2026-09/4_19.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-23T06:58:30.433397+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":249,"images":9,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}